#: ../../source/peripherals/uart.md:270
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`TLK_UART_SELECTED**   Indicates that at least one UART instance is "
"enabled in the system. This option is automatically selected when any "
"`UART{i}_ENABLED` option is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/peripherals/uart.md:273
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`TLK_UART_USED_AUTO_CONFIG`**   Indicates that automatic UART "
"configuration is enabled in the system. This option is automatically "
"selected when `UART{i}_AUTO_CONFIG` is enabled for any UART instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/peripherals/uart.md:276
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`TLK_UART_USED_IRQ`**   Indicates that at least one UART instance needs"
" a PLIC functionality. This option is automatically selected when "
"`UART{i}_USED_IRQ` or `UART{i}_USED_DMA` are enabled for any UART "
"instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/peripherals/uart.md:279
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`TLK_UART_USED_DMA`**   Indicates that at least one UART instance needs"
" a DMA functionality. This option is automatically selected when "
"`UART{i}_USED_DMA` is enabled for any UART instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/peripherals/uart.md:282
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`TLK_UART_USED_PM_DEVICE`**   Indicates that UART power management "
"support is enabled in the system. This option is automatically selected "
"when `UART{i}_PM_DEVICE` is enabled for any UART instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/peripherals/uart.md:285
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`TLK_UART_USED_FLOW_CONTROL`**   Indicates that hardware flow control "
"(RTS/CTS) is enabled in the system. This option is automatically selected"
" when `UART{i}_FLOW_CONTROL` is enabled for any UART instance."
msgstr ""

